WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.764 --> 00:00:14.353
You probably recognize my at least my golden mask.

2
00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:28.664
probably recognize my face—or at least my golden mask.

3
00:00:30.292 --> 00:00:32.534
Most people know me as King Tut from ancient Egypt.

4
00:00:34.595 --> 00:00:36.297
But my real name is Tutankhamun.

5
00:00:38.678 --> 00:00:42.301
I became an Egyptian pharaoh, or king, when I was about nine years old.

6
00:00:43.162 --> 00:00:44.523
But my reign was not long.

7
00:00:46.564 --> 00:00:49.226
I was only 19 when I died from an unknown cause.

8
00:00:51.287 --> 00:00:54.070
My people buried me in a tomb in the Valley of the Kings.

9
00:00:55.270 --> 00:00:57.192
That's where many other pharaohs were buried.

10
00:00:59.472 --> 00:01:02.894
I was an important king, and I made many big changes to Egypt.

11
00:01:04.155 --> 00:01:08.137
But people soon forgot about me, and I was lost for over three thousand years!

12
00:01:10.939 --> 00:01:15.642
Then, in 1922, a British archaeologist named Howard Carter discovered my tomb.

13
00:01:19.244 --> 00:01:21.606
Carter and his team were amazed by what they found.

14
00:01:22.606 --> 00:01:25.428
The rooms of my tomb were filled with thousands of objects.

15
00:01:28.280 --> 00:01:32.521
That was because we ancient Egyptians believed the dead needed things for the afterlife.

16
00:01:33.582 --> 00:01:38.283
With me, I had golden chariots, furniture, food, wine—even underwear!

17
00:01:39.824 --> 00:01:41.644
My coffin was made of solid gold.

18
00:01:44.465 --> 00:01:47.286
It took Carter ten years to remove everything from my tomb.

19
00:01:51.887 --> 00:01:53.908
People were excited about Carter's discovery.

20
00:01:55.496 --> 00:01:58.157
Mine was the most complete pharaoh's tomb ever found.

21
00:01:59.657 --> 00:02:01.818
Other tombs had been robbed of valuable objects.

22
00:02:03.558 --> 00:02:06.459
In fact, robbers had actually broken into my tomb twice!

23
00:02:07.079 --> 00:02:08.860
But they weren't able to steal very much.

24
00:02:10.040 --> 00:02:13.121
The contents of my tomb were displayed at the Egyptian Museum in Cairo.

25
00:02:14.222 --> 00:02:19.383
Later some objects traveled across the world.

26
00:02:19.483 --> 00:02:22.484
In 1939, two of my trumpets were played on the radio.

27
00:02:26.096 --> 00:02:27.837
I hope the audience enjoyed the concert.

28
00:02:28.478 --> 00:02:30.959
I heard that 150 million people were listening!

29
00:02:33.421 --> 00:02:36.443
The most famous treasure from my tomb was the golden mask on my mummy.

30
00:02:38.224 --> 00:02:40.405
Originally, this mask wasn't meant for me at all!

31
00:02:42.106 --> 00:02:44.047
It had first been made for a different pharaoh.

32
00:02:45.909 --> 00:02:48.190
But when I died, it was used on me instead.

33
00:02:49.571 --> 00:02:50.992
The mask had to be changed though.

34
00:02:55.104 --> 00:02:58.047
The original owner's face was removed from the front of the mask.

35
00:03:00.609 --> 00:03:03.371
Then a new face that looked like mine was placed on the mask.

36
00:03:04.612 --> 00:03:06.854
My name was written over the original owner's name.

37
00:03:08.375 --> 00:03:12.518
Other objects—maybe even the tomb itself—were probably meant for someone else too.

38
00:03:13.619 --> 00:03:15.741
Most pharaohs had large, grand tombs.

39
00:03:17.462 --> 00:03:19.043
But mine is small and simple.

40
00:03:21.665 --> 00:03:24.508
Archaeologists think my death was sudden and unexpected.

41
00:03:25.096 --> 00:03:27.818
So they believe a grander tomb wasn't ready when I died.

42
00:03:28.959 --> 00:03:31.701
Today I'm known as the most famous pharaoh from ancient Egypt.

43
00:03:34.003 --> 00:03:35.904
But much about me still remains a mystery.

44
00:03:36.965 --> 00:03:39.847
For example, nobody is exactly sure how I died.

45
00:03:40.668 --> 00:03:42.529
Maybe one day someone will find out.

46
00:03:44.691 --> 00:03:47.673
I believe people will be interested in my life for many years to come.

47
00:03:49.734 --> 00:03:51.736
I have plenty of secrets waiting to be discovered!
